1
00:00:00,953 --> 00:00:03,433
Look, I'm a lonely guy;
I watch a lot of movies.

2
00:00:04,723 --> 00:00:05,893
(Raj:)Look, Penny,

3
00:00:06,058 --> 00:00:09,168
(Raj:)if you truly want to be romantic,
it needs to come from you.

4
00:00:09,328 --> 00:00:11,398
(Penny:)I get that, but why is this so hard?

5
00:00:11,563 --> 00:00:14,063
(Raj:)Well, you've probably never had
to do this stuff 'cause you're young

6
00:00:14,233 --> 00:00:16,343
(Raj:)and beautiful and men have
always thrown themselves at you.

7
00:00:19,004 --> 00:00:21,504
(Penny:)Yeah, I'm trying to be sad
about that. I can't.

8
00:00:26,011 --> 00:00:29,121
(Sheldon:)Let's see, what's next?
Okay! Here.

9
00:00:29,281 --> 00:00:31,091
(Sheldon:)This is the Magic Marker

10
00:00:31,250 --> 00:00:33,460
(Sheldon:)I was using
when I made the discovery.

11
00:00:35,354 --> 00:00:37,424
(Amy:)I don't think the Smithsonian's
gonna want your marker.

12
00:00:37,589 --> 00:00:40,869
(Sheldon:)And that's why you're not
on the list for my tree fort.

13
00:00:44,797 --> 00:00:46,797
Ooh! Guess who's getting an article

14
00:00:46,966 --> 00:00:48,466
(Sheldon:)written about him in Physics Today?

15
00:00:48,634 --> 00:00:50,114
(Sheldon:)I'll give you a hint.

16
00:00:50,269 --> 00:00:53,149
(Sheldon:)You measured the diameter
of his suspicious mole yesterday.

17
00:00:55,641 --> 00:00:56,981
(Amy:)Sheldon, I'm so proud of you.

18
00:00:57,142 --> 00:01:00,212
(Sheldon:)Well, you should be. My discovery
is spreading like wildfire.

